  "description": "High-performance object-to-object mapper for .NET with an AutoMapper-style API, in one package: compiled expression-tree mappings, ML.NET fuzzy member matching, EF Core projection/Persist/key equality, OData query support, and scheduled diagnostics reports (exceptions, performance, memory-leak indicators) delivered to a folder, webhook or SFTP.",
